#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:7
msgid ""
"From Mattermost server v10.12 and mobile v2.32, Mattermost deployments "
"can use a reverse proxy to validate authentication secrets before "
"allowing desktop and mobile requests to reach the Mattermost server. This"
" adds an additional security layer by checking for the ``X-Mattermost-"
"Preauth-Secret`` header."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 서버 v10.12 및 모바일 v2.32부터, OKR.BEST 배포는 데스크톱·모바일 "
"요청이 OKR.BEST 서버에 도달하기 전에 리버스 프록시를 사용해 인증 시크릿을 "
"검증할 수 있습니다. 이는 ``X-Mattermost-Preauth-Secret`` 헤더를 확인하여 추가 "
"보안 계층을 더합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:9
msgid ""
"Authentication secrets are only supported for mobile and desktop "
"applications. When a secret is required, desktop prompts users directly "
"while mobile displays the secret field in Advanced Options. Web browser "
"clients don't support this feature."
msgstr ""
"인증 시크릿은 모바일과 데스크톱 애플리케이션에서만 지원됩니다. 시크릿이 "
"필요할 때 데스크톱은 사용자에게 직접 입력을 요청하고, 모바일은 고급 옵션에 "
"시크릿 필드를 표시합니다. 웹 브라우저 클라이언트는 이 기능을 지원하지 "
"않습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:11
msgid ""
"When authentication secret validation fails, the reverse proxy must "
"return the ``X-Reject-Reason: pre-auth`` header along with the 403 status"
" code. This header allows mobile and desktop applications to specifically"
" identify authentication failures and provide appropriate error messaging"
" to users."
msgstr ""
"인증 시크릿 검증이 실패하면 리버스 프록시는 403 상태 코드와 함께 ``X-Reject-"
"Reason: pre-auth`` 헤더를 반환해야 합니다. 이 헤더를 통해 모바일·데스크톱 "
"애플리케이션이 인증 실패를 구체적으로 식별하고 사용자에게 적절한 오류 "
"메시지를 제공할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:15
msgid ""
"We recommend whitelisting certain endpoints where the authentication "
"header may not be available. The specific endpoints depend on your "
"authentication configuration:"
msgstr ""
"인증 헤더를 사용할 수 없는 특정 엔드포인트는 허용 목록에 추가할 것을 "
"권장합니다. 구체적인 엔드포인트는 인증 구성에 따라 다릅니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:17
msgid ""
"``/api/v4/notifications/ack`` - Required for proper notification "
"acknowledgement functionality"
msgstr ""
"``/api/v4/notifications/ack`` - 올바른 알림 확인(acknowledgement) 기능에 "
"필요합니다"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:18
msgid ""
"``/static/*``, ``/api/v4/config/client`` and ``/login/desktop`` - "
"Required for authentication flows that redirect to the browser, such as "
"SAML, OAuth and OpenID"
msgstr ""
"``/static/*``, ``/api/v4/config/client``, ``/login/desktop`` - SAML, "
"OAuth, OpenID처럼 브라우저로 리디렉션하는 인증 플로에 필요합니다"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:20
msgid "**Additional endpoints based on your authentication setup:**"
msgstr "**인증 설정에 따른 추가 엔드포인트:**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:22
msgid "SAML: ``/login/sso/saml``"
msgstr "SAML: ``/login/sso/saml``"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:23
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"OpenID: ``/oauth/{service:[A-Za-z0-9]+}/complete``, "
"``/oauth/{service:[A-Za-z0-9]+}/login``, "
"``/oauth/{service:[A-Za-z0-9]+}/mobile_login``, "
"``/oauth/{service:[A-Za-z0-9]+}/signup``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:24
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"OAuth: ``/api/v3/oauth/{service:[A-Za-z0-9]+}/complete``, "
"``/signup/{service:[A-Za-z0-9]+}/complete``, "
"``/login/{service:[A-Za-z0-9]+}/complete``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:26
msgid ""
"These endpoints are whitelisted because they're accessed during "
"authentication flows where the authentication header can't be provided, "
"such as OAuth redirects through external identity providers."
msgstr ""
"이 엔드포인트는 외부 ID 공급자를 통한 OAuth 리디렉션처럼 인증 헤더를 제공할 "
"수 없는 인증 플로에서 접근되므로 허용 목록에 추가합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:29
msgid "NGINX configuration example"
msgstr "NGINX 구성 예시"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:31
msgid ""
"Here's an example partial NGINX configuration that validates the "
"authentication secret header:"
msgstr "다음은 인증 시크릿 헤더를 검증하는 부분 NGINX 구성 예시입니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:99
msgid ""
"Replace ``your-secure-auth-secret-here`` with a strong, unique secret "
"that will be configured in your mobile and desktop applications. Store "
"this secret securely and rotate it regularly as part of your security "
"practices."
msgstr ""
"``your-secure-auth-secret-here``\\ 를 모바일·데스크톱 애플리케이션에 구성할 "
"강력하고 고유한 시크릿으로 교체하세요. 이 시크릿을 안전하게 저장하고 보안 "
"관행의 일환으로 정기적으로 교체하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:101
msgid ""
"For Apache2 configuration guidance, see `Configuring Apache2 as a proxy "
"for Mattermost Server <https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-"
"us/articles/41170740463764-Configuring-Apache2-as-a-proxy-for-Mattermost-"
"Server-Unofficial>`_."
msgstr ""
"Apache2 구성 안내는 `Configuring Apache2 as a proxy for Mattermost Server "
"<https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-us/articles/41170740463764-"
"Configuring-Apache2-as-a-proxy-for-Mattermost-Server-Unofficial>`_\\ 를 "
"참고하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:104
msgid "Rotate secrets"
msgstr "시크릿 교체"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:106
msgid "To rotate an authentication secret:"
msgstr "인증 시크릿을 교체하려면:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:108
msgid "Generate a new secret: ``openssl rand -base64 32``."
msgstr "새 시크릿을 생성합니다: ``openssl rand -base64 32``."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:109
msgid "Update your reverse proxy configuration with the new secret."
msgstr "리버스 프록시 구성을 새 시크릿으로 갱신합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:110
msgid "Reload the reverse proxy."
msgstr "리버스 프록시를 다시 로드합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:111
msgid "Notify users:"
msgstr "사용자에게 알립니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:113
msgid ""
"**Desktop users**: No action needed. They'll be automatically prompted "
"for the new secret on their next connection attempt."
msgstr ""
"**데스크톱 사용자**: 별도 조치가 필요 없습니다. 다음 연결 시도 시 새 시크릿 "
"입력을 자동으로 요청받습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:114
msgid ""
"**Mobile users**: Manually update the secret by editing the server in the"
" app by tapping **Servers**, swiping left, tapping **Edit > Advanced "
"Options** and updating the **Authentication secret**."
msgstr ""
"**모바일 사용자**: 앱에서 **Servers**\\ 를 탭하고 왼쪽으로 스와이프한 뒤 "
"**Edit > Advanced Options**\\ 를 탭하여 **Authentication secret**\\ 을 "
"갱신해 시크릿을 직접 업데이트합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:117
msgid "Security considerations"
msgstr "보안 고려 사항"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:121
msgid ""
"The Mattermost desktop application stores authentication secrets using "
"Electron's ``safeStorage`` API, which integrates with the operating "
"system's secure credential storage:"
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 데스크톱 애플리케이션은 운영 체제의 보안 자격 증명 저장소와 "
"통합되는 Electron의 ``safeStorage`` API를 사용해 인증 시크릿을 저장합니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:123
msgid "**Windows**: Windows Credential Manager"
msgstr "**Windows**: Windows 자격 증명 관리자"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:124
msgid "**macOS**: Keychain Access"
msgstr "**macOS**: 키체인 접근"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:125
msgid ""
"**Linux**: Secret Service API (requires kwallet, gnome-libsecret, or "
"compatible backend)"
msgstr ""
"**Linux**: Secret Service API(kwallet, gnome-libsecret 또는 호환 백엔드 "
"필요)"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:127
msgid ""
"For more information about Electron's secure storage behavior, see the "
"`Electron safeStorage documentation "
"<https://www.electronjs.org/docs/latest/api/safe-storage>`_."
msgstr ""
"Electron의 보안 저장소 동작에 대한 자세한 내용은 `Electron safeStorage 문서 "
"<https://www.electronjs.org/docs/latest/api/safe-storage>`_\\ 를 "
"참고하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:131
msgid ""
"On Linux systems where no secure credential storage is available, the "
"authentication secret may be stored in **plain text**. This occurs when:"
msgstr ""
"보안 자격 증명 저장소를 사용할 수 없는 Linux 시스템에서는 인증 시크릿이 "
"**일반 텍스트**\\ 로 저장될 수 있습니다. 다음 경우에 발생합니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:133
msgid "No secret store backend is available (kwallet, gnome-libsecret, etc.)"
msgstr "시크릿 저장소 백엔드를 사용할 수 없음(kwallet, gnome-libsecret 등)"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:134
msgid "The desktop environment is not recognized"
msgstr "데스크톱 환경이 인식되지 않음"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:135
msgid "The system falls back to Electron's ``basic_text`` storage"
msgstr "시스템이 Electron의 ``basic_text`` 저장소로 폴백함"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:137
msgid ""
"The file is stored with permissions to prevent unauthorized access by "
"other users, though the secret remains unencrypted. Consider the security"
" implications before deploying authentication secrets in your "
"environment."
msgstr ""
"파일은 다른 사용자의 무단 접근을 막는 권한으로 저장되지만, 시크릿 자체는 "
"암호화되지 않은 상태로 남습니다. 환경에 인증 시크릿을 배포하기 전에 보안 "
"영향을 고려하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:141
msgid ""
"The Mattermost mobile application stores authentication secrets using "
"platform-native secure storage:"
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 모바일 애플리케이션은 플랫폼 네이티브 보안 저장소를 사용해 인증 "
"시크릿을 저장합니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:143
msgid "**iOS**: iOS Keychain"
msgstr "**iOS**: iOS 키체인"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:144
msgid "**Android**: Android Keystore system"
msgstr "**Android**: Android Keystore 시스템"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:146
msgid ""
"Mobile authentication secrets are always encrypted. Unlike desktop Linux "
"systems, there is no plaintext fallback on mobile platforms."
msgstr ""
"모바일 인증 시크릿은 항상 암호화됩니다. 데스크톱 Linux 시스템과 달리 모바일 "
"플랫폼에는 일반 텍스트 폴백이 없습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/pre-authentication-secrets.rst:148
msgid ""
"The authentication secret is included in all network requests, including "
"REST API calls, WebSocket connections, and requests from share extensions"
" and notification handlers."
msgstr ""
"인증 시크릿은 REST API 호출, WebSocket 연결, 공유 확장 및 알림 핸들러의 "
"요청을 포함한 모든 네트워크 요청에 포함됩니다."

